any danger when you log out.

84
00:08:55,980 --> 00:08:59,392
But you should call the cops
when you do, just to be safe!

85
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:03,200
Okay, but what am I supposed to tell them?

86
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:05,000
Oh yeah, right.

87
00:09:06,100 --> 00:09:08,217
The guy I work for is with the government.

88
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:11,065
I could ask him to send
the cops to your place?

89
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,257
But how am I going to get your info?

90
00:09:13,340 --> 00:09:15,340
I can't really ask for it in here?

91
00:09:17,580 --> 00:09:19,800
It's cool, I'll tell you. Huh?

92
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,160
Are you sure?

93
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:24,220
My name is Shino.

94
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:25,700
Shino Asura.

95
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,220
And I live here.

96
