Talk about a lack of imagination.

114
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,960
Yeah, well, like you're one to talk.

115
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:23,861
All right, then.

116
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:27,657
If we're ever going to log out of
this thing, we've got to end B .O .B.

117
00:10:27,740 --> 00:10:28,570
first.

118
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,704
