who's already as thrashed as you.

124
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:46,917
Nah, I'll take you on at the next B .O
.B., but you better not leave me hanging.

125
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,830
Ugh.

126
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:51,127
Well, let's get this
thing over with already.

127
00:10:52,100 --> 00:10:53,747
How are we going to do that?

128
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:58,017
Unless one of our HPs drains out all the
way, there's not going to be a winner.

129
00:10:58,100 --> 00:11:00,937
I guess you didn't hear what
happened in the first POB.

130
00:11:01,020 --> 00:11:02,257
