152
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:55,200
I just wanted to
congratulate you on your win.

153
00:13:55,540 --> 00:13:57,280
I even brought some pastries.

154
00:14:00,300 --> 00:14:01,580
Hey, congrats.

155
00:14:01,860 --> 00:14:03,740
You were so awesome, Asura.

156
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:07,400
I mean, Sinon, you did it.

157
00:14:07,620 --> 00:14:09,700
You're the best gunner in GGO now.

158
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:13,320
I knew all along you could do it.

159
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:16,845
You deserve being number
one more than anybody.

160
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:19,725
You showed them all what
real strength's about.

161
00:14:19,820 --> 00:14:20,996
You should be proud.

162
00:14:21,980 --> 00:14:23,020
Thank you.

163
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:26,750
Asada?

164
00:14:27,220 --> 00:14:28,180
What's up?

165
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:30,860
You said to wait.

166
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:32,260
Remember that?

167
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:34,280
What are you talking about?

168
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:40,100
Well, you told me to wait, and if
I did, then you'd be mine. Huh?

169
00:14:41,180 --> 00:14:42,137
I waited.

170
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:43,800
I waited for you.

171
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:46,060
What's gotten into you?

172
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:50,980
From now on, I'll always be with you.

173
00:14:51,820 --> 00:14:53,860
You don't need him to protect you.

174
00:14:54,220 --> 00:14:55,200
That's my job.

175
00:14:55,780 --> 00:14:57,309
I'm gonna protect you now.

176
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,190
Forever.

177
00:15:08,620 --> 00:15:09,450
Shinkawa!

178
00:15:09,533 --> 00:15:10,680
I love you, Asura.

179
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:12,660
You're mine.

180
00:15:12,900 --> 00:15:14,817
My Asada. My...

181
00:15:14,900 --> 00:15:17,120
Xenon. Mine.

182
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:19,660
Let go!

183
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:28,640
Why'd you push me away like that?

184
00:15:29,140 --> 00:15:30,680
You made a promise.

185
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,020
We both did.

186
00:15:33,700 --> 00:15:34,620
Shinkawa?

187
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:53,670
Shing...

188
00:15:53,753 --> 00:15:54,583
Shinkawa?

189
00:15:55,180 --> 00:15:57,240
Don't make any sudden moves, Asura.

190
00:15:58,380 --> 00:16:00,497
The syringe I'm holding's got a drug in it

191
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:03,168
that'll paralyze your
muscles in an instant.

192
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:06,477
Before you know it, your lungs
will stop, then your heart.

193
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:07,390
Syringe?

194
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:10,741
Maybe by injecting some
kind of drug or something?

195
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,080
That's one way.

196
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:14,760
Yeah, it is the family business.

197
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:18,477
I promised my dad I'd go to med
school, so it's a done deal.

198
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:19,619
Stuck with it now.

199
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:22,160
This is crazy.

200
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:25,340
You're the other Death Gun.

201
00:16:27,300 --> 00:16:29,100
Ooh, I'm impressed.

202
00:16:29,700 --> 00:16:32,171
You figured out Death Gun's little secret.

203
00:16:32,700 --> 00:16:33,640
It's true.

204
00:16:34,040 --> 00:16:36,060
I'm Death Gun's partner in crime.

205
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:43,317
Up to now, before this year's B .O .B.

206
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:45,694
anyway, I was the one playing Shterben.

207
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:51,060
But today, I insisted on being
the one to do the job IRL.

208
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:52,960
Don't you see?

209
00:16:53,100 --> 00:16:55,017
I had to be the one doing the deed.

210
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:59,340
I can't let some other guy touch
you, even if that guy's my brother.

211
00:16:59,940 --> 00:17:00,980
Your brother?

212
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:06,580
So then, the player who belonged
to that murder guild and SAO?

213
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,980
That was your older brother.

214
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:10,520
Forget about him.

215
00:17:10,860 --> 00:17:13,020
It's just you and me now, Asada.

216
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:16,350
Stop!

217
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:18,020
It's not too late.

218
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:20,940
You don't have to do this.

219
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,620
What about cram school, huh?

220
00:17:24,020 --> 00:17:26,160
You said you were gonna be a doctor.

221
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:27,750
Doctor?

222
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:31,460
You think I'd give a damn about that?

223
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,260
About my parents?

224
00:17:33,460 --> 00:17:34,800
Those guys in school?

225
00:17:35,020 --> 00:17:36,340
They're all assholes!

226
00:17:37,680 --> 00:17:39,457
You know what would have made me happy?

227
00:17:39,540 --> 00:17:41,540
To be the strongest player in GGO.

228
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:46,273
But that piece of shit Sugou Seed lied
about AGI-types being the strongest.

229
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:48,600
And I fell for it like an idiot!

230
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:51,080
You don't know.

231
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:53,380
GGO was everything to me.

232
00:17:53,700 --> 00:17:57,600
And I gave everything up in the
real world for it, goddammit!

233
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:02,840
You killed Sugou Seed because he lied?

234
00:18:03,300 --> 00:18:04,500
Oh, come on.

235
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:06,097
He was the perfect victim.

236
00:18:06,180 --> 00:18:11,360
We had to show the world Death Gun was
the strongest in GGO, in all the VR Miss.

237
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:14,285
What better person to
sacrifice than that dork?

238
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:18,740
And now that that's done, I
don't need this reality anymore.

239
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:21,880
Let's move on to the next one.

240
00:18:22,320 --> 00:18:23,791
Come on, just you and me.

241
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,680
What are you saying?

242
00:18:26,140 --> 00:18:28,120
We can go somewhere like GGO.

243
00:18:29,620 --> 00:18:32,208
No, someplace with the
fantasy vibe instead.

244
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:34,674
As long as it's with you, I don't care.

245
00:18:38,040 --> 00:18:39,300
We'll be reborn.

246
00:18:39,620 --> 00:18:40,677
Be husband and wife.

247
00:18:40,760 --> 00:18:41,590
We'll get a house.

248
00:18:41,673 --> 00:18:42,997
We'll go on quests together.

249
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,900
Oh, and have kids, too.

250
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,397
It'll be so much fun.

251
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,740
I know I will.

252
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,477
Come with me. Asuna.

253
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:51,000
You're so beautiful.

254
00:18:51,460 --> 00:18:53,677
You are more than anything.

255
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:56,480
You're mine and no one else's.

256
00:18:57,280 --> 00:18:59,860
I always loved you, Asuna. Always.

257
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:03,028
In school, when I heard
about what happened,

258
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:04,840
when I heard what you did,

259
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:09,000
I could look all over and never
find another girl like you.

260
00:19:09,340 --> 00:19:13,960
I mean, you shot a real bad guy
with a real gun and killed him.

261
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,960
How cool is that?

262
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:17,920
I told you, didn't I?

263
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:20,220
I said you had real power.

264
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:24,037
Then I came up with the Death Gun legend.

265
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:27,120
And I picked the Type 54
as his gun because of you.

266
00:19:28,300 --> 00:19:30,300
That's how much I love you, Asuna.

267
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:33,000
I love you so much.

268
00:19:33,620 --> 00:19:34,920
More than anything.

269
00:19:37,460 --> 00:19:38,290
No.

270
00:19:56,120 --> 00:20:01,020
I don't want to see anything
or feel anything anymore.

271
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:05,817
This isn't real.

272
00:20:05,900 --> 00:20:07,060
It can't be.

273
00:20:10,780 --> 00:20:17,120
Kirito, you went to all that trouble
to save me, but it was all for nothing.

274
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:19,162
How about this?

275
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:21,909
After we log out, I
could head over to you.

276
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:25,800
If he comes over, he'll be in danger.

277
00:20:27,840 --> 00:20:30,400
And I can't do anything about it.

278
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:33,060
That's not true.

279
00:20:35,140 --> 00:20:39,199
Up to this point, all we've been
doing was looking out for ourselves.

280
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:42,180
We certainly never fought for anyone else.

281
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:49,060
But now, even though it might be too late
for us, let's go fight for someone else.

282
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:51,200
Just this once, me and you.

283
00:21:07,180 --> 00:21:09,160
Come on. Let's go.

284
00:21:14,100 --> 00:21:16,120
I love you, Asuna.

285
00:21:36,340 --> 00:21:37,170
Asuna!

286
00:21:37,253 --> 00:21:38,083
Asuna!

287
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:41,070
No!

288
00:21:41,153 --> 00:21:42,120
Let go of me! No!

289
00:21:45,340 --> 00:21:49,940
Asuna! Asuna! Asuna! Asuna! Asuna!

290
00:21:56,280 --> 00:21:57,110
Let's go!

291
00:21:57,193 --> 00:21:58,023
Run, Xenon!

292
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:04,730
Kirito...

293
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:50,560
Once again, there's no one need to go.

294
00:22:53,620 --> 00:22:57,580
I want to be stronger and stronger,

295
00:22:58,620 --> 00:23:02,100
I want to be a dream.

296
00:23:02,960 --> 00:23:04,820
I want to be a dream like this,

297
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:38,620
Next time, one little step.
